<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ulster TV H1 pre-tax profit up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>Ulster TV H1 pre-tax profit up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.95		   vs 4.67</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.25		   vs 2.00</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.67		   vs 3.66</p>
<p>Note: Ulster Television Plc said it has pulled out of participation in a third television channel.  </p>
<p> Turnover		   17.07		  vs 16.82</p>
<p> Operating profit	 2.98		   vs 2.78</p>
<p> Tax			  1.54 charge	  vs 1.21 charge</p>
<p> Net taxed		  3.13		   vs 2.46</p>
<p> Registration date	October 8</p>
<p> Pay date		   October 22</p>
<p> Ex-dividend date	 September 9</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
